2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - **flatpickr** with `altInput: true` and `monthSelectPlugin` — creates a visible alt input; initializes via `inicializarFlatpickr()` globally on `.flatpickr-month-year` elements; stores instance as `element._flatpickr`; requires visible DOM for proper initialization with monthSelectPlugin
   - **Bootstrap modal lifecycle**: `modal('show')` starts CSS animation; `shown.bs.modal` fires when fully visible; elements in hidden modal (`display:none`) may cause flatpickr+monthSelectPlugin `_bind` errors
   - **`seleccionarActualmenteTrabajo(bool)`**: destroys existing flatpickr, empties `#fechas-trabajo-experiencia`, appends new HTML, calls `inicializarFlatpickr()`
   - **`seleccionarGraduadoCursando()`**: same pattern for `#fechas-cursando-estudios` — now also destroys flatpickr before emptying (added in this session)
   - **`inicializarFlatpickr()`** in `inputs.js`: global initialization of ALL `.flatpickr-month-year`, `.flatpickr`, `.flatpickr-range`, CKEditor elements on the page; uses `if (this._flatpickr) return` guard
   - **`.one('shown.bs.modal', fn)`**: jQuery one-time event listener for deferred initialization after modal is fully visible
   - **`limpiarFormulario(id)`**: resets form inputs (`.val('')`), selects, textareas; does NOT reset checkbox `checked` state or rebuild dynamic containers
   - **Controller-Service-Repository pattern** (project standard, not directly relevant to this work)

